==Battleground==
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Juri (Enemy)|Juri]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**4 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

